WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hi, friends. Gani here.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Let's play a noticing game.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
We use our senses to notice where we are — right here, right now.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
We count down together: five, four, three, two, one.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
First, five things you can see.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Look around, slow and easy. Find five things.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Now, four things you can hear.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Listen close. Listen far. Just notice the sounds.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Three things you can feel, right where you sit.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.000
The desk under your hands. Your chair. Your feet in your shoes.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Two things you can smell.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Breathe in through your nose… and notice.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.000
And one — one slow breath, together.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Breathe in… two, three, four. Breathe out… two, three, four.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Notice your body now.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Quiet hands. Soft shoulders. Calm and steady.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Eyes up. Hands back.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Ready to learn.
